  (`build-and-deploy` failing in ~6 seconds on every push to main).
  Cause: `.github/workflows/javadoc.yml` was written at commit
  `baf918b`, BEFORE the 2026-07-29 Ant/NetBeans-to-Maven conversion,
  and was never updated for the new layout. It passed
  `-sourcepath src` (sources now live in `src/main/java`; plain `src`
